extends Room
## A test yard for the Stray. Not listed by the game (the folder starts with "_").
## Run it with: godot --path . -- --room=_stray_demo
##
## Walk toward the tower and the Stray runs ahead to point at it. The television on the left
## is awake: walk near it and the Stray hides behind your legs. The one on the right is
## asleep: stand still near it and the Stray curls up beside it.
